WEBVTT - Sunita Devi Testimonial (English)

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
I am Sunita Devi from Mahmudabad, Sitapur district in Uttar Pradesh.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.500
When my labor complications started late at night at 2:00 AM, my family was in utter panic with no vehicle available.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.500
We called our local Aapka Swasthya-Mitra Sarita, who arranged emergency ambulance transport within 20 minutes.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
She accompanied us to the empanelled maternity hospital and ensured immediate admission without initial cash deposit hurdles.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Both my newborn baby and I are healthy today because Aapka was by our side in that critical hour.
